<title>ARGENTINA: ARGENTINA TO AUCTION LETES T-BILLS AUG 12.</title>
<headline>ARGENTINA TO AUCTION LETES T-BILLS AUG 12.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina will auction 250 million pesos of 91-day Letes treasury bills and $250 million of 182-day Letes on August 12, the Economy Ministry said Thursday.</p>
<p>The sale will take place through a Dutch auction. Settlement will be on August 15.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
